      ("Carousel caption", "Swipe ➡️ for the full tour of our newest listing.\n\n1️⃣ Living room with [double-volume ceiling]\n2️⃣ [Fitted] kitchen\n3️⃣ Master suite with [walk-in closet]\n4️⃣ [Rooftop terrace]\n\n📍 [Area] | ₦___\nSave this post and send it to someone house hunting 🏠"),
