      ("Payment plan focus", "Own a home in [Area] for ₦___ deposit 🔑\nThe rest? Spread over [18] months, [no interest].\n\n[3]-bed [terrace duplex] at [Development]\nCompletion [date]. DM \"PLAN\" for the breakdown."),
